      "en": "Controlling the filtration<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>If the construction of the filtering element is of minor importance, the documents are classified in this group only<br> Filters integrally combined with devices for controlling the filtration are also classified in the relevant groups for these aspects, e.g. B01D24/48, B01D29/60, B01D33/804",
