      "en": "with stationary adsorbents {(B01D53/025 takes precedence)}<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>In groups B01D53/0462 and B01D53/047 - B01D53/0476 it is desirable to add indexing codes chosen from B01D2259/40007 - B01D2259/40081 relating to controlling and processing aspects of pressure or temperature swing adsorption",
