    "B01D61/00": {
      "code": "B01D61/00",
      "level": 7,
      "parent": null,
      "ja": "半透膜を用いる分離工程，例．透析，浸透，限外ろ過；そのために特に適用される装置，付属品または補助操作<br><br><u>注</u><br><br>グループＢ０１Ｄ６１／００～Ｂ０１Ｄ６１／５８においては工程の操作または制御に関してグループＢ０１Ｄ２３１１／００～Ｂ０１Ｄ２３１１／２６９６から選択されるインデキシングコードを付加することが望ましい，<br>膜のモジュールまたは装置の細部に関してＢ０１Ｄ２３１３／００～Ｂ０１Ｄ２３１３／９０から選択されるインデキシングコード，<br>膜モジュールの操作の細部に関してＢ０１Ｄ２３１５／００～Ｂ０１Ｄ２３１５／１６から選択されるインデキシングコード，<br>設備または装置内の膜モジュール装置の細部に関してＢ０１Ｄ２３１７／００～Ｂ０１Ｄ２３１７／０８から選択されるインデキシングコードおよび<br>１つのハウジング内の膜アセンブリの細部に関してＢ０１Ｄ２３１９／００～Ｂ０１Ｄ２３１９／０６",
      "en": "Processes of separation using semi-permeable membranes, e.g. dialysis, osmosis or ultrafiltration; Apparatus, accessories or auxiliary operations specially adapted therefor (separation of gases or vapours by diffusion B01D53/22)<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>When classifying in this group, the indexing codes of the following groups must be added if applicable: <br>B01D2311/00 for details related to process operations and control; <br>B01D2313/00 for details related to membrane modules or apparatus;<br>B01D2315/00 for details related to the membrane module operation;<br>B01D2317/00 for details related to the module arrangement within a plant or an apparatus;<br>B01D2319/00 for details related to the membrane assembly within one housing.<br>Multistep processes comprising two or more membrane-separation steps of different kinds must be classified in B01D61/58 in combination with the subgroup for the specific steps. The symbols relating to the specific steps are added as \"additional information.\"<br>Multistep processes comprising two or more membrane-separation steps of the same kind must be classified in the subgroup covering the specific multistep membrane separation, e.g. B01D61/029 for processes comprising two or more reverse osmosis steps, B01D61/3621 for processes comprising two or more pervaporation steps.",
      "count": 2528,
      "ipcCode": "B01D61/00",
      "coreCode": "B01D61/00",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_B01D.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
